          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عربة — ʿaraba — \"a carriage; a cart\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلسنا في العربة الأخيرة من القطار. jalasnā fī al-ʿaraba al-akhīra min al-qiṭār. We sat in the last carriage of the train."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عربة (ʿaraba) names a cart and a railway carriage; the origin is not settled, and some trace it to Turkish araba."
            }
          ]
        },
