          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مقصورة (maqṣūra) is built on the native Arabic root q-ṣ-r, \"to confine, to keep within bounds\" (Lane). It is a passive participle: a space closed off, a compartment."
            }
          ]
        },
